    "beatInBar": 0,
    "intent": "The third cry is left hanging. The voice stops after the F5 and does not come home; for two beats the pocket carries on without it and the listener supplies the missing descent. The mallet echo, which until now only repeated what the voice had just sung, now speaks into the gap alone.",
    "reason": "The hook is already learnable after two statements; a third identical one teaches nothing and spends the tonic one beat before the cadence needs it. Taking three notes away keeps the head, the groove and every sound exactly as they are and makes the one thing the listener already knows the thing that is missing. Adding a variation here would cover the hook; silence exposes it.",
